                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "You are shown a radiant warmer in a neonatal unit. A preterm newborn under the warmer has a recorded temperature of 35.8°C."
                },
                {
                  "type": "checklist",
                  "items": [
                    "Your tasks"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Identify the equipment and name four components."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Explain its principle of operation."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "State the normal neonatal temperature range."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Describe how you would investigate and manage the low temperature."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Name four potential complications of incorrect use."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "group_id": "radiant_warmer_group_35",
              "group_title": "Rapid revision checklist",
              "group_subtitle": null,
              "group_icon": null,
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Identification: Open neonatal bed with overhead radiant heating element."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Principle: Radiant heat transfer."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Main purpose: Maintain neonatal temperature while allowing access."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Control modes: Manual/pre-warm and servo-control, depending on the model."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Normal temperature: 36.5–37.5°C."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Main safety concern: Correct probe placement and continuous assessment."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Key comparison: Radiant warmer allows easier access; incubator provides an enclosed thermal environment."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
